Grammar

    0 $accept: prog $end

    1 prog: classOrImplOrFuncList

    2 classOrImplOrFuncList: classOrImplOrFunc classOrImplOrFuncList
    3                      | ε

    4 classOrImplOrFunc: classDecl
    5                  | implDef
    6                  | funcDef

    7 classDecl: CLASS ID inheritanceOpt LBRACE visibilityMemberList RBRACE SEMI

    8 inheritanceOpt: ISA ID idList
    9               | ε

   10 idList: COMMA ID idList
   11       | ε

   12 implDef: IMPLEMENT ID LBRACE funcDefList RBRACE

   13 funcDefList: funcDef funcDefList
   14            | ε

   15 funcDef: funcHead funcBody

   16 funcHead: FUNC ID LPAREN fParams RPAREN ARROW returnType
   17         | CONSTRUCTOR LPAREN fParams RPAREN

   18 funcBody: LBRACE varDeclOrStmtList RBRACE

   19 visibility: PUBLIC
   20           | PRIVATE

   21 visibilityMemberList: visibility memberDecl visibilityMemberList
   22                     | ε

   23 memberDecl: funcDecl
   24           | attributeDecl

   25 funcDecl: funcHead SEMI

   26 attributeDecl: ATTRIBUTE varDecl

   27 localVarDecl: LOCAL varDecl

   28 varDecl: ID COLON type arraySizeList SEMI

   29 arraySizeList: arraySize arraySizeList
   30              | ε

   31 arraySize: LBRACKET INTLIT RBRACKET
   32          | LBRACKET RBRACKET

   33 varDeclOrStmtList: localVarDeclOrStmt varDeclOrStmtList
   34                  | ε

   35 localVarDeclOrStmt: localVarDecl
   36                   | statement

   37 statement: simpleStmt SEMI
   38          | ifStmt SEMI
   39          | whileStmt SEMI

   40 simpleStmt: idStmt
   41           | selfStmt
   42           | READ LPAREN variable RPAREN
   43           | WRITE LPAREN expr RPAREN
   44           | RETURN LPAREN expr RPAREN

   45 idStmt: ID idStmtTail

   46 idStmtTail: ASSIGN expr
   47           | LBRACKET expr RBRACKET idArrayTail
   48           | LPAREN aParams RPAREN
   49           | DOT ID idMemberTail

   50 idArrayTail: ASSIGN expr
   51            | LBRACKET expr RBRACKET ASSIGN expr

   52 idMemberTail: ASSIGN expr
   53             | LBRACKET expr RBRACKET ASSIGN expr
   54             | LPAREN aParams RPAREN

   55 selfStmt: SELF DOT ID selfMemberTail

   56 selfMemberTail: ASSIGN expr
   57               | LBRACKET expr RBRACKET ASSIGN expr
   58               | LPAREN aParams RPAREN

   59 ifStmt: IF LPAREN expr RPAREN THEN statBlock elseOpt

   60 elseOpt: ELSE statBlock
   61        | ε

   62 whileStmt: WHILE LPAREN expr RPAREN statBlock

   63 statBlock: LBRACE statementList RBRACE
   64          | statement
   65          | ε

   66 statementList: statement statementList
   67              | ε

   68 variable: ID variableTail
   69         | SELF DOT ID variableTail

   70 variableTail: LBRACKET expr RBRACKET variableTail
   71             | DOT ID variableTail
   72             | ε

   73 expr: relExpr

   74 relExpr: arithExpr relExprPrime

   75 relExprPrime: relOp arithExpr
   76             | ε

   77 relOp: EQ
   78      | NE
   79      | LT
   80      | GT
   81      | LE
   82      | GE

   83 arithExpr: term arithExprPrime

   84 arithExprPrime: addOp term arithExprPrime
   85               | ε

   86 addOp: PLUS
   87      | MINUS
   88      | OR

   89 term: factor termPrime

   90 termPrime: multOp factor termPrime
   91          | ε

   92 multOp: MULT
   93       | DIV
   94       | AND

   95 factor: INTLIT
   96       | FLOATLIT
   97       | LPAREN expr RPAREN
   98       | NOT factor
   99       | sign factor
  100       | ID factorTail
  101       | SELF factorSelfTail

  102 factorTail: LPAREN aParams RPAREN
  103           | LBRACKET expr RBRACKET
  104           | DOT ID factorMemberTail
  105           | ε

  106 factorMemberTail: LPAREN aParams RPAREN
  107                 | LBRACKET expr RBRACKET
  108                 | ε

  109 factorSelfTail: DOT ID factorMemberTail

  110 sign: PLUS
  111     | MINUS

  112 type: INTEGER_KW
  113     | FLOAT_KW
  114     | ID

  115 returnType: type
  116           | VOID

  117 fParams: ID COLON type arraySizeList fParamsTail
  118        | ε

  119 fParamsTail: COMMA ID COLON type arraySizeList fParamsTail
  120            | ε

  121 aParams: expr aParamsTail
  122        | ε

  123 aParamsTail: COMMA expr aParamsTail
  124            | ε


